      "title": "3. Information Processing in Neural Circuits",
      "gist": "Transfer shows flow but not how streams combine, so multivariate decomposition is proposed to study processing itself.",
      "question": "Information processing — why is information transfer not enough to capture it?",
      "sourceHeading": "3. Information Processing in Neural Circuits"
    },
