      "title": "6. Practical Considerations in PID",
      "gist": "Using PID well requires matching the redundancy measure to the data type, having enough data, choosing tools, and recognizing its interpretive and computational limits.",
      "question": "PID practice — what must analysts watch for when applying it to their own data?",
      "sourceHeading": "6. Practical Considerations in PID"
    },
